@archive 0024
@size 5

script 0 mmsf3 {
	bgmStop
		fadeTime = 0
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"궤도 기지에 온 것을 환영한다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"와 줘서 고맙다,\n록맨."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아니, 이렇게 불러야 하나...\n호시카와 스바루."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"그 팝업을 보낸 게\n당신이야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"그래."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"킹의 오른팔이라는\n그 여자 아니야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"하트리스라고 불러."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 알려 두지...\n킹은 이제 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"이제 없어...?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"계획에 약간 차질이 생겨서\n내가..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사실 시간이 별로 없으니\n간단히 말하겠다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"잭과 티아가 딜러를\n장악했다고?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그리고 메테오 G를 행성에\n충돌시키려 한다고?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"대충 그런 셈이야..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"두 사람은 지금\n[Area0103]에 있다.\n이곳에서 전파 변환해 들어갈 수"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"가능한 한 빨리 그들을\n막아 줘."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"메인 프로그램을 덮어쓰면\n메테오 G가 지구에\n충돌해..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"충돌할 때 사라지는\n건 전파 기술만이\n아니야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"엄청난 충격파가 발생해\n인류의 80%가\n목숨을 잃게 될 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"끔찍해!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"세상에나!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"하지만 그 둘은 그 결과가\n얼마나 심각한지 모르고 있어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"설령 알고 있다 해도,\n눈을 보면 멈출 생각이 없다는 걸\n알 수 있을 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"알겠어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하트리스..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"덮어쓰기를 끝내기 전에\n내가 막겠어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"세계의 운명이 네게 달려 있다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"잠깐만."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"왜, 워록?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"너 정체가 대체 뭐야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 여기서 뭘\n하려는 거지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아까도 말했지만,\n지금은 시간이 없다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"잭과 티아를 막아 줘."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"세상이 안전해진 뒤에\n모든 걸 설명하겠다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"가자, 워록!!\n저 둘을 막지 않으면\n그러면 세상이..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"어쩔 수 없겠네...\n나중에 전부 말해 줘야 해,\n아가씨!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"약속할게..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
